.\"},\"EIvSTp3NyIdV6Dto1Qhx\":{\"s_product_key\":\"EIvSTp3NyIdV6Dto1Qhx\",\"s_version\":\"1.0.8\",\"fk_i_item_id\":\"169\",\"s_osc_version_from\":\"3.0\",\"s_osc_version_to\":\"\",\"last_update_date\":\"2024-02-06 13:41:07\",\"s_comment\":\"It is now possible to hook \\\"FAQ\\\" button\\/link to header from backoffice, using Osclass hooks 8.2\"},\"L3IN81p4BJP0UU4pc0Xk\":{\"s_product_key\":\"L3IN81p4BJP0UU4pc0Xk\",\"s_version\":\"1.6.8\",\"fk_i_item_id\":\"170\",\"s_osc_version_from\":\"3.3\",\"s_osc_version_to\":\"\",\"last_update_date\":\"2026-03-16 09:37:49\",\"s_comment\":\"Improved handling of item forms.\\nOther minor issues fixed.\"},\"qcj6opM6HtKfMtlsbAdv\":{\"s_product_key\":\"qcj6opM6HtKfMtlsbAdv\",\"s_version\":\"1.1.5\",\"fk_i_item_id\":\"171\",\"s_osc_version_from\":\"3.0\",\"s_osc_version_to\":\"\",\"last_update_date\":\"2025-03-03 10:45:29\",\"s_comment\":\"New messages when follow\\/unfollow button is hit and subscribe option enabled (when new alert is created with follow and alert is deactivated with unfollow).\\nUser is now aware that alert has been created and where to manage it.\"},\"KFHwr9v7MXDv8z7Gaxqf\":{\"s_product_key\":\"KFHwr9v7MXDv8z7Gaxqf\",\"s_version\":\"1.0.3\",\"fk_i_item_id\":\"173\",\"s_osc_version_from\":\"3.3\",\"s_osc_version_to\":\"\",\"last_update_date\":\"2025-12-11 09:30:04\",\"s_comment\":\"Fixed bug when business profile was synced even this was disabled.\"},\"5sGWW11Q4k2ZPOiLKmbH\":{\"s_product_key\":\"5sGWW11Q4k2ZPOiLKmbH\",\"s_version\":\"1.0.8\",\"fk_i_item_id\":\"174\",\"s_osc_version_from\":\"3.3\",\"s_osc_version_to\":\"\",\"last_update_date\":\"2026-03-11 08:55:52\",\"s_comment\":\"Fixed issue with validation\\/confirmation requirements.\"},\"4Ru93z0aGeUifioD2FZF\":{\"s_product_key\":\"4Ru93z0aGeUifioD2FZF\",\"s_version\":\"1.0.0\",\"fk_i_item_id\":\"175\",\"s_osc_version_from\":\"3.0\",\"s_osc_version_to\":\"\",\"last_update_date\":\"2021-10-25 08:04:52\",\"s_comment\":\"Initial Plugin Release\"},\"aCwcTb5tF8XHaOLMIrjB\":{\"s_product_key\":\"aCwcTb5tF8XHaOLMIrjB\",\"s_version\":\"1.1.0\",\"fk_i_item_id\":\"176\",\"s_osc_version_from\":\"3.0\",\"s_osc_version_to\":\"\",\"last_update_date\":\"2025-01-27 22:12:09\",\"s_comment\":\"Updated instructions\"},\"nqygcFAScb360OQIyr5L\":{\"s_product_key\":\"nqygcFAScb360OQIyr5L\",\"s_version\":\"1.1.5\",\"fk_i_item_id\":\"177\",\"s_osc_version_from\":\"3.0\",\"s_osc_version_to\":\"\",\"last_update_date\":\"2026-05-21 13:11:01\",\"s_comment\":\"Improved compatibility with future versions of Osclass.\\nFixed minor issues.\"},\"FxBSA3UNkXmCsJ5Rk5h2\":{\"s_product_key\":\"FxBSA3UNkXmCsJ5Rk5h2\",\"s_version\":\"1.0.6\",\"fk_i_item_id\":\"178\",\"s_osc_version_from\":\"3.0\",\"s_osc_version_to\":\"\",\"last_update_date\":\"2024-07-26 08:52:59\",\"s_comment\":\"Fixed few small bugs.\"},\"vliNRyxVet2OKwvL6b9L\":{\"s_product_key\":\"vliNRyxVet2OKwvL6b9L\",\"s_version\":\"1.0.2\",\"fk_i_item_id\":\"179\",\"s_osc_version_from\":\"3.0\",\"s_osc_version_to\":\"\",\"last_update_date\":\"2023-02-24 21:11:43\",\"s_comment\":\"Fixed bug that caused to show views counter on other than item pages.\"},\"DxMMDzXC3d39tvALXnGE\":{\"s_product_key\":\"DxMMDzXC3d39tvALXnGE\",\"s_version\":\"1.0.6\",\"fk_i_item_id\":\"180\",\"s_osc_version_from\":\"3.0\",\"s_osc_version_to\":\"\",\"last_update_date\":\"2024-10-28 09:29:22\",\"s_comment\":\"PHP notices bug fix.\"},\"dI2zdwnHWj1TnMldUVji\":{\"s_product_key\":\"dI2zdwnHWj1TnMldUVji\",\"s_version\":\"1.1.0\",\"fk_i_item_id\":\"181\",\"s_osc_version_from\":\"3.0\",\"s_osc_version_to\":\"\",\"last_update_date\":\"2026-05-29 20:47:02\",\"s_comment\":\"Major update: Limits now apply to all main contact forms, including user profile contact and send-to-friend.\\nProtection works by email, IP address, and browser session, so rotating email or IP alone is harder.\\nSend-to-friend and profile contact forms are handled correctly (previously unreliable or missing).\\nBlocked words and usage limits are enforced more consistently, with clearer admin logs by form type.\\nGeneral stability fixes so limits and logging work reliably on older Osclass versions (including 3.8).\"},\"bieyVwillf6RUKpr4hav\":{\"s_product_key\":\"bieyVwillf6RUKpr4hav\",\"s_version\":\"1.1.2\",\"fk_i_item_id\":\"182\",\"s_osc_version_from\":\"3.0\",\"s_osc_version_to\":\"\",\"last_update_date\":\"2025-01-29 11:21:11\",\"s_comment\":\"Updates in license and terms of use.\"},\"xQFfpbyJt23FfLDCWz92\":{\"s_product_key\":\"xQFfpbyJt23FfLDCWz92\",\"s_version\":\"1.1.0\",\"fk_i_item_id\":\"183\",\"s_osc_version_from\":\"3.0\",\"s_osc_version_to\":\"\",\"last_update_date\":\"2026-03-19 08:46:46\",\"s_comment\":\"Major update: Way how adblocker extensions are identified has been extended.\\nAdmin can select external url of advertising network to check to be loaded (Google, Yandex, Facebook,...).\\nLocal bait has been added as well to check if is possible to load local script with \\\"advert-like\\\" name.\"},\"viI5pwIYUEk2IpfpZc40\":{\"s_product_key\":\"viI5pwIYUEk2IpfpZc40\",\"s_version\":\"1.0.3\",\"fk_i_item_id\":\"184\",\"s_osc_version_from\":\"3.0\",\"s_osc_version_to\":\"\",\"last_update_date\":\"2025-11-19 15:25:36\",\"s_comment\":\"Added option for users to select \\\"remember this device\\\" that will not pop-up 2FA authentication for 30 days by default. This setting complement \\\"threshold days\\\".\"},\"8SJ2E17vwNNdd27OqJOC\":{\"s_product_key\":\"8SJ2E17vwNNdd27OqJOC\",\"s_version\":\"1.1.0\",\"fk_i_item_id\":\"185\",\"s_osc_version_from\":\"3.0\",\"s_osc_version_to\":\"\",\"last_update_date\":\"2023-12-20 08:49:54\",\"s_comment\":\"Many improvements and fixes, especially with listings in search page.\"},\"IM1Ebj5mSpL1XNFeY7ua\":{\"s_product_key\":\"IM1Ebj5mSpL1XNFeY7ua\",\"s_version\":\"1.1.0\",\"fk_i_item_id\":\"186\",\"s_osc_version_from\":\"3.0\",\"s_osc_version_to\":\"\",\"last_update_date\":\"2026-01-05 14:56:57\",\"s_comment\":\"Added dark mode support (thanks for help from customer).\"},\"IDzeo3EbACMp7NXeb0