. Requires Osclass Pay v4.2.5 or higher.\"},\"fPrtEdWPmuY92KCdwFRL\":{\"s_product_key\":\"fPrtEdWPmuY92KCdwFRL\",\"s_version\":\"1.0.5\",\"fk_i_item_id\":\"261\",\"s_osc_version_from\":\"3.0\",\"s_osc_version_to\":\"\",\"last_update_date\":\"2026-02-20 08:10:32\",\"s_comment\":\"Added option to collect tax id from business customers (EU): With tax ID collection enabled, Checkout shows and hides the tax ID collection form depending on your customer\\u2019s location. If your customer is in a location supported by tax ID collection, Checkout shows a tickbox allowing the customer to indicate that they\\u2019re purchasing as a business. When a customer ticks the box, Checkout displays fields for them to enter the tax ID and legal entity name for the business. If available, Checkout uses the customer\\u2019s shipping address to determine their location, otherwise Checkout uses the customer\\u2019s billing address. Customers can only enter one tax ID.\"},\"wxIeq0Ht3ymM803jo8vM\":{\"s_product_key\":\"wxIeq0Ht3ymM803jo8vM\",\"s_version\":\"1.0.5\",\"fk_i_item_id\":\"262\",\"s_osc_version_from\":\"3.0\",\"s_osc_version_to\":\"\",\"last_update_date\":\"2025-12-21 15:44:37\",\"s_comment\":\"Fixed webhook issue with amounts &gt; 999.\"},\"wM3pPUU6c30ZpBy7wgS1\":{\"s_product_key\":\"wM3pPUU6c30ZpBy7wgS1\",\"s_version\":\"1.0.4\",\"fk_i_item_id\":\"263\",\"s_osc_version_from\":\"3.0\",\"s_osc_version_to\":\"\",\"last_update_date\":\"2025-12-21 16:57:31\",\"s_comment\":\"Payment gateway integration now supports positioning. Requires Osclass Pay v4.2.5 or higher.\"},\"WsKMLaZ92xXmGE7s7KiY\":{\"s_product_key\":\"WsKMLaZ92xXmGE7s7KiY\",\"s_version\":\"1.0.0\",\"fk_i_item_id\":\"264\",\"s_osc_version_from\":\"3.0\",\"s_osc_version_to\":\"\",\"last_update_date\":\"2025-06-02 09:14:56\",\"s_comment\":\"Initial service release\"},\"VByiBU5qmrIG8dsOkrA9\":{\"s_product_key\":\"VByiBU5qmrIG8dsOkrA9\",\"s_version\":\"1.0.3\",\"fk_i_item_id\":\"265\",\"s_osc_version_from\":\"3.0\",\"s_osc_vers